{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "3399697e29ce293c5c051668753ccc2c1ebfbae1b28639a48bad1319ddcabe9c", "ja": "……ええと、『スターティング・ブルーム』に、\n『インフィニティストーム』……。", "zh": "……那个，《Starting Bloom》，\n还有《Infinity Storm》……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "1ca144d6c6b8f5f9fa4103da0d5c579228b9d9496ca3f8500ef42a087b6a8fb9", "ja": "それから『Code:EScape』と、\nこれは……『夢見るリトルレディ』。", "zh": "然后是《Code:EScape》，\n这个是……《梦见的小淑女》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "28742368f5226921b70c485e8c4187feecc94e48217b1485c7cc11b2942e55d1", "ja": "『プレティーン・プリテンダー』に、『エトワール・\nブリヤント』……うん、どれもバッチリです！", "zh": "『プレティーン・プリテンダー』、『エトワール・ブリヤント』……嗯，每件都完美无缺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "39c16918d166390982eff9508d55a610b9a5962a5f98cc192fc238e30d3c90dd", "ja": "はい、数も状態も問題なし、と……。\nこれで衣装の定期確認はおしまいです！", "zh": "好的，数量和状态都没有问题……  \n这样一来，服装的定期检查就结束了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "f2ca39f5ecaabc7dd0c954492240f044c70453ae5589c18eefe9d49988425f94", "ja": "ありがとうございました～。\n手伝ってもらえて本当に助かりました♪", "zh": "非常感谢你～。\n能有人帮忙真是帮了大忙了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "0e7cb75d061ee812c66c19117cc793b0304d2c10e0532b8d433745290cf470cc", "ja": "いえ、こちらこそ。しっかり管理してもらえて、\n本当に助かります。", "zh": "哪里，我才要道谢呢。能由你来妥善管理，\n真的帮了大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "f79c506b03c63e39b400fab74a326c6c5243897c172215f0a89c3847a5180a38", "ja": "アイドルたちを輝かせる大切な衣装ですからね。\nしかも数も多いのに、デザインから製作まで……。", "zh": "毕竟是让偶像们大放光彩的重要服装嘛。  \n而且数量还那么多，从设计到制作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "dfb9c3c9455ffae5a58ab16b6537214457f306d088d1579e0a1ae8a416a31f60", "ja": "製作まで……全部、青羽さん一人で……ん？\nよく考えたら、一体どうやって……？", "zh": "制作……全部都是青羽一个人……嗯？\n仔细想想，她到底是怎么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "a7c4debdcce76bd919c045253987c4361fcd4573871c65d8bac1e7abd1ce1f8a", "ja": "？　プロデューサーさん、\nどうかしましたか？", "zh": "？制作人先生，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "15e3de49f1c97a0ff169b64e8037a8f51988a6fb3b590ca5ebdd4631bae5a2f5", "ja": "あ、いえ、なんでもないです。\nただ、俺も頑張らなくちゃって。", "zh": "啊，不，没什么。\n只是，我也得努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "abcfe85bf3732d840f6791c8b95ca43b4c991d80333ebc5628d0a34bc419a592", "ja": "？　そうですか？　でもプロデューサーさんは、\nとっても頑張ってると思いますよ♪", "zh": "？是这样吗？不过我觉得制作人先生已经非常努力了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "b8a70bb5f30104d7066edede829c7f15d838a298256835cd87d4040fddb310ae", "ja": "今日も事務所でミーティングがあるのに、こんな直前\nまで手伝ってくれたりして。ありがとうございます！", "zh": "明明今天事务所还有会议，您却一直帮忙到临近开始。谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "1acbf5552ba6072a990c8298b0132dc0f350333307736907e03413f89ccf69e4", "ja": "あ。……ああっ！？", "zh": "啊。……啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "3c7eea8d22e9a3e52ce9a0794c2022c3b11e0676dd352b852d2736150bae6faf", "ja": "忘れてた～～～～！！", "zh": "我忘了～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1017_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "863dac297080bc92566ad93b269405fa1d864234eaed889d8e029ddadf0137bd", "ja": "ぜえ、ぜえ、ぜえ、間に合った……。\nお、おはようございますっ！！　お疲れ様です！！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……赶上了……  \n早、早上好！！辛苦了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "2653be2d0d512a4d8949ef83b240937204cff1b90c955674a33acd3953022a86", "ja": "あらプロデューサーさん、お疲れさまです♪\n社長、プロデューサーさんがご到着ですよ～。", "zh": "哎呀制作人，辛苦啦♪\n社长，制作人到了哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "af61f69a1545d7a3ddc980bd9705cab08c30d726f25b208cedcec220b79cc305", "ja": "おお、待っていたよ！　時間ピッタリとは、さすが……\nうん？　ずいぶん疲れているようだが、大丈夫かね？", "zh": "哦，我一直在等你呢！时间刚刚好，不愧是……\n\n嗯？看起来你很累，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "de8b25ad40175658cfe98887d305b7d328679569c666478d14e3cf6391eed3a0", "ja": "はい、もう、これぐらい、全然……うっぷ。\n……平気ですっ！", "zh": "没事，这点程度，完全……呃。  \n……我没事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "8423994334a693edd35dd05531cf983e7ef659abde3b479da21ef272bd1f417b", "ja": "そ、そうか。ならいいんだが……\nいや忙しいところ、わざわざすまなかったね。", "zh": "这、这样啊。那就好，不过……\n不，百忙之中还特意麻烦你，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "8f03515f8915c2547d7266d06e58730160860f35b94dd09b9d6bf0bbbaae7194", "ja": "本当ですよ。チーフの出張中は、負担が全部\nプロデューサーさんにいっちゃうんですから。", "zh": "就是啊。主任出差期间，所有负担都会落到制作人先生身上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "26bdf12883eaabbd10b0623c67831e49eb6fb391e441ac67542a56e29043124d", "ja": "幕張第三高校との学園祭タイアップ企画も終わった\nばかりで、まだまだお疲れのはずですよ？", "zh": "和幕张第三高中的学园祭联动企划也才刚刚结束，\n您现在应该还很累吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "3d37e9af13bef919a36169f6c69340d45e7e2b571480925c45e052cc87547fea", "ja": "いえ、本当に大丈夫です。今度の公演は俺の担当だし、\nそれに……青羽さんはもっと頑張ってそうだし。", "zh": "不，真的没关系。这次公演是由我负责的，而且……青羽小姐好像比我还努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "fee8104549c893314bcd846e251cacb5c00b9c5238fb09be7235e0124b0e36b5", "ja": "俺もしっかりやり遂げて見せます！", "zh": "我也会好好完成给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "c9268ce9c6f027923568388c6d8b81eaf5fb0ad74d3f514db924934c08839732", "ja": "おお、なんとも頼もしい……結構結構！\nそれでこそ私が見込んだプロデューサーだ！", "zh": "哦，真是可靠……很好很好！\n这才是我看中的制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "ae337f118bdf84ba9b5bdbee56e9387d19edebb81c056999993589bf166c438f", "ja": "では、早速本題に入るとしよう。\n他でもない、その今度の公演、つまり……", "zh": "那么，马上进入正题吧。\n不是别的，正是下次的公演，也就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "bf7287f03b9ce3c88d44bdca3686869f83e6f66971ac1286e1053b6ce88d7beb", "ja": "宮尾美也君、天空橋朋花君、徳川まつり君の3人による\n新曲公演のことだ！　準備は進んでいるかね？", "zh": "是由宫尾美也、天空桥朋花、德川茉莉3人带来的\n新曲公演的事情！准备得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "587a957d52bd5a9b17cc32c68d5ca3178bf2475ae527a7927025eacf937c8aaf", "ja": "3人も学園祭と準備が並走して、大変そうでしたよね？", "zh": "她们3个人要同时筹备校庆，看起来挺辛苦的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "0a08babd8bde4af451d921ce8f6a28d66e0a2d7e694777f27a93c7e28d8754ec", "ja": "はい……でもアイドルたちは、呼んでくれた生徒達と\n一緒に、学祭ライブをしっかりやり遂げてくれました。", "zh": "是的……不过，偶像们还是和邀请她们前来的学生们一起，顺利完成了学园祭演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "a21889ebe2067c5caac9cc5c06fc5aed7d051f2f2f1fc55050119f2829e7c402", "ja": "もちろん公演の準備もしっかり進めてくれています。\nそして……。", "zh": "当然，演出的准备工作也在稳步进行。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_intro_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "b907dd6bf72ea4b5c7329547193b72ed7d3a339a859c4961ee78a133092ea84d", "ja": "今日から、いよいよ本格始動です！\n輝きを増した3人のステージに、期待してください！", "zh": "从今天开始，终于要正式启动了！\n敬请期待变得更加闪耀的3人的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
